# 44. CORE RULES

```text
RULE 01
Fairy observes autonomous missions.

RULE 02
Fairy does not need to report every minor action.

RULE 03
Important and critical events must be reported.

RULE 04
Mission reports are divided into sessions.

RULE 05
Session count is dynamic.

RULE 06
Mission Type determines the basic session structure.

RULE 07
Random Events can create additional sessions.

RULE 08
Previous sessions can influence future sessions.

RULE 09
Hero personality can influence narrative.

RULE 10
Hero relationships can influence narrative.

RULE 11
Hero skills can appear in narrative events.

RULE 12
Autonomous decisions must be recorded.

RULE 13
Critical situations trigger immediate notification.

RULE 14
Final Mission Report summarizes the entire mission.

RULE 15
Mission Narrative must use actual mission data.

RULE 16
Narrative should not change the actual game result.

RULE 17
Narrative is a presentation layer over the real
Mission / Combat / Loot / Hero systems.

RULE 18
All Mission Logs must be stored with unique IDs.

RULE 19
The system must support replaying the mission log.

RULE 20
The Fairy should explain important autonomous
decisions so the Master understands what happened.
```

